# Pairs with MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites. The move copies the stream without
# waiting for it to drain (WalShardGrain.DrainInFlightAsync is skipped; the
# placement-version abort WalMoveFenceCore.ShouldAbortStaleQuiesce is a separate
# check), so an append already in flight when the fence rose lands on the old
# home after the copy, is acknowledged, and is dropped at the switch.
MODULE: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWritesCopyUnquiesced
TARGET: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a move copies the stream while appends are still in flight and loses them at the switch
PERTURBS: MoveCopy

--- FIND
    /\ inflight = {}
    /\ dfence
    /\ moveCopy' = durable
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no quiesce before the copy.
    /\ dfence
    /\ moveCopy' = durable
--- END